    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2AQW6P2N6EYPpitFRc2Pui9)_\n\n`sp-tabs` already set `tabspaces-session` and `tabspaces-session-auto-restore`, but `tabspaces-mode` was never enabled, so nothing was saved or restored.\n\n- Start `tabspaces-mode` from `after-init`.\n- Keep the session in `var/tabspaces-session.eld` (`tabspaces-session-file`).\n- Update the literate doc and CHANGELOG.\n\nNot run in Emacs (no Emacs in the cloud container); please try it with `emacs-pr`. Only file-visiting buffers are saved.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01Mvh9mKiDhrqVt6NMQDx5mf)_",
